# macOS
.DS_Store

# App Store screenshots are **committed**, under docs/app-store-assets/ — see
# CLAUDE.md. They are the assets uploaded to App Store Connect, so their diff
# is the listing's diff.
# A run's capture.json result sits beside each set and holds local paths.
docs/app-store-assets/*.capture.json
